{
  "_comment": [
    "Where the dial comes from, and exactly which commit of it is in this tree.",
    "tools/sync-dial.py regenerates every file listed here from this commit, so",
    "the port is reproducible rather than a copy somebody made once. CI re-runs",
    "it and fails on any difference, which is what stops the ported files being",
    "hand-edited and silently diverging from upstream."
  ],
  "repo": "https://github.com/meltface-80/dial-for-Roon",
  "commit": "0b5839863f659f9a7e21911bf65de80661d43399",
  "package": "com.musicd.lite.android.dial",
  "files": [
