  "_rewrites_comment": [
    "Applied in order to every synced file. Each is a plain string replacement,",
    "declared here rather than buried in the script so the whole difference",
    "between upstream and this tree is one readable list. If a sync ever needs a",
    "rewrite that is not a plain substitution, that is the signal the file has",
    "stopped being portable and wants adapting by hand instead."
  ],
